      "title": "Normal gauges, abnormal vibration",
      "kind": "field_case",
      "difficulty": "advanced",
      "summary": "A system trips after 38–45 minutes although pressure and temperature remain normal. A subtle vibration pattern is the first useful clue.",
      "critical_cues": [
        "failure appears only after thermal stabilization",
        "vibration signature changes before trip",
        "recent coupling replacement is absent from current work order"
